sequenceDiagram
    actor 用户
    用户->>CLI: python -m repo_agent "psf/requests"
    CLI->>Pipeline: run(input)
    Pipeline->>GitHubClient: get_repo / commits / issues / contributors
    GitHubClient-->>Pipeline: RepoMetadata
    Pipeline->>Cloner: fetch_repo(tarball 优先)
    Cloner-->>Pipeline: 本地代码路径
    par 并行分析
        Pipeline->>Analyzers: metadata + docs
        Pipeline->>Analyzers: code + security
    end
    Analyzers-->>Pipeline: 各维度 findings
    opt 开了 --use-llm
        Pipeline->>LLM: 总评(智谱 glm-4-flash)
        LLM-->>Pipeline: 自然语言诊断
    end
    Pipeline->>Reporter: render_markdown(HealthReport)
    Reporter-->>文件: reports/psf_requests.md
    Pipeline-->>用户: 打印报告路径
